  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Exfoliating Soap.png|200px|left|Exfoliating soap]]\n\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Products|Product]]\n |level = 93\n |price = 1 to 363\n |time = 1 hr\n |source = {{Infoicon|bathk|bigger|link=Bath Kiosk}}\n |xp = 43\n |base = 101\n |dia = 4\n |time3 = 51 min\n}}\n'''Exfoliating soap''' is a [[Products|product]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 93.\n\nLike all [[products]], it is stored in the [[barn]].\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Making exfoliating soap'''===\n[[File:Bath Kiosk.png|150px|left|Bath Kiosk]]\nExfoliating soap is made in the [[Bath Kiosk]].\n\nTo make exfoliating soap, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: .5em 0;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Cacao.png|75px|Cacao|link=Cacao]]\n|[[File:Coffee Bean.png|75px|Coffee bean|link=Coffee Bean]]\n|[[File:Raspberry.png|75px|Raspberry|link=Raspberry]]\n|-\n|'''x2'''\n|'''x2'''\n|'''x1'''\n|}\nIt takes 1 hour to make one bar of exfoliating soap, and 51 minutes in a fully [[Masteries|mastered]] kiosk. Each bar gives players 43 [[experience]] points.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Selling exfoliating soap'''===\n[[File:Roadside Shop.png|150px|left|Roadside shop]]\n\n*Exfoliating soap can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 3,636 {{Infoicon|Coin}} for 10 bars.\n*Buying the ingredients required to make exfoliating soap costs 346 {{Infoicon|Coin}}.\n\n{{Clr}}----\n==='''Boat orders'''===\n[[File:Riverboat.png|150px|left|Riverboat]]\n\n*[[Boat]] orders ask for 1 to 2 exfoliating soaps per crate, up to a total of 8 per boat.\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Strategy tips'''===\n* Probably the easiest to produce out of all 5 products. However, [[Cacao]] require substantial amount of time to grow and highly demand in many other products, they are not easy to find in the [[Daily Dirt]] as well. \n{{Clr}}\n----\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Peeling-Seife\n|es = Jabón exfoliante\n|fr = Savon Exfoliant\n|it = Sapone esfoliante\n|nl = Exfolierende Zeep\n|no = Såpe\n|ru = Мыло-скраб\n|zh = Exfoliating Soap\n}}\n[[pt-br:Sabonete exfoliante]]\n\n[[Category:Bath Kiosk Products]]\n[[Category:Coffee Bean Products]]\n[[Category:Cacao Products]]\n[[Category:Raspberry Products]]",
